 turn (which ever is greater) depending on talents.\nAll damage you take from an outside source will increase your Feedback based on to how much of your health is lost and your level.  First level characters gain 100 Feedback when losing 50% health, while 50th level characters gain the same amount when losing 20% health.\n","source_tag":"_t","target":"#GOLD#反馈值#LAST#\n反馈值反映你能利用你的痛苦来释放灵能，可以用于释放反馈系技能。\n反馈值每回合按 10% 或 1 点（取较大者）衰减，具体衰减速率还受技能影响。\n你从外界受到的所有伤害都会增加你的反馈值，增加的数值取决于你损失生命值的百分比和你的等级。1级人物在损失50%生命后获得100反馈值，而50级人物损失20%生命后获得同样多的反馈值。\n"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"f496c0cfdc72fca36cf5ce9c67699afd65798ecef3486b463d9fd1e79f53f05f","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"b24ecd1c6703a1e3d660cd97ad5d2a91457de15a315913da507546ffb8af8033","logical_entry_identity":"1cfe4a1aa90f9b7a0f8649218e9bce9b8da4f1e4fc3160e02dff2d9bf5be1434","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"The temporal warden gives you: %s.","source_tag":"log","target":"时空守卫给了你：%s。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"dacd5de38093b9b74bd4353b1efb640f1979a6de2bb61b7e30fefc321f5b9712","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"b251a9ef127ce72ab4d1ce50ed4092e20286fd012968ef483012299aa514f477","logical_entry_identity":"2a9ffecc7cd70c7b310393d8ea8da630941caa43e17817974d25bb804869c60c","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"See invisible: ","source_tag":"_t","target":"侦测隐形："},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"6b4a2b5cba7a686acba5e55960608a8b703573345af46c3f718f91a16e06adaa","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"b25ab60571ab59bedffb3346cbcdd428543e39f1be1d3769e713e0960f986f71","logical_entry_identity":"d04c352b7cc54ff2e74b0ee0cb995ab0468201311ce34d282a92ff82b9c9b576","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Sing a song of wasting and desolation which sustains you in hard times.\n\nThis dirge increases your health regeneration by %d.  The regeneration will increase with your level.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"为荒废和孤寂悲叹一曲来支持困境中的你。\n\n增加你的生命回复%d。回复量受等级加成。"},{"args_order":null,"call_l